related_trials.eligibility_brief:
1. Age between 18 and 75 years;
2. Karnofsky performance status (KPS) score ≥ 70;
3. Pathologically confirmed World Health Organization (WHO) type II-III NPC;
4. TNM stage I-III (T1-3N0-2M0) according to the 8th American Joint Committee on Cancer / Union for International Cancer Control (AJCC/UICC)…
